  "id": "blackberry-jalapen-o-jelly",
  "name": "Blackberry Jalapeño Jelly",
  "subtitle": "Sweet blackberry spread with a gentle peppered kick",
  "description": "A bright fruit jelly combining blackberry juice, sugar, pectin, and minced jalapeños. Fill prepared jars, allow the jelly to set, then chill before serving.",
